<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 88 MLN 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 88 MLN 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland on Friday sold 88 million zlotys worth of 91-day NBP-bills and set the minimum price at 95.29, after investors bid for 182 million zlotys, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the 91-day paper was 19.47 percent, up from a 18.60 percent average yield for a comparable 13-week T-bill sold at last Monday's primary auction.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
